WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.649
Start with any blank form
your staff already fill in.

2
00:00:10.649 --> 00:00:14.604
Here: West Virginia's
blank form, WV-BMS-IDD-7.

3
00:00:14.604 --> 00:00:19.589
It reads every question
and every box.

4
00:00:19.589 --> 00:00:24.770
Three forms in those pages.
Pick the one staff write on.

5
00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:30.651
Shown back filled in,
with a made-up person.

6
00:00:30.651 --> 00:00:34.855
Something wrong?
Fix it before anyone uses it.

7
00:00:34.855 --> 00:00:38.515
Looks right? Use it.

8
00:00:38.515 --> 00:00:43.500
Every new note is written on it.
Signed notes keep their form.

9
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:53.567
A different form? Same steps.
Here: DC's daily notes, as a PDF.

10
00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:59.136
Its own title and every one
of its questions, rebuilt.

11
00:00:59.136 --> 00:01:03.133
Your form, rebuilt
for your staff to write on.
